'''Nu-Cosian''' were a [[DNA|genetically]]-[[engineer]]ed offshoot of the [[Cosian]] [[species]]. They were created to colonize the [[planet]] [[Cos Secundu]].<ref name="A&S" /> They were long-necked bipeds with muscular tails they used for balance and self-defense.<ref name="AotG" /> [[Bobbajo]] belonged to the species.<ref name="Great and Small">{{StoryCite|story=All Creatures Great and Small|book=Tales from a Galaxy Far, Far Away: Aliens: Volume I}}</ref>

